\Section{The objective is within-cell homogeneity and across-cell heterogeneity}
We compare stated need, acquisition channel, age band and region on the same \VAR{segmentation_objective_n} customers, the same six-payment contribution outcome and two groups per strategy. The aim is to put customers with more similar economics together while separating groups that warrant different decisions.

Stated need produces the greatest separation. Its commercial meaning is clear: build-skill members remain longer and generate more contribution.

